    "title": "DreameShort - Dramas and Shows",
    "description": "DreameShort is the new generation of mini-drama series streaming platform.\r\n\r\nLife is short - make every moment thrilling with DreameShort. We deliver maximum entertainment in minimum time. Satisfy your drama cravings now with our ever-expanding bite-sized library!\r\n\r\nGet your drama fix anytime, anywhere with DreameShort! We offer a huge collection of original short form series, with episodes ranging from 1-5 minutes, so you can binge watch on the go. Whether you're commuting, waiting in line, or squeezing in me-time, DreameShort's ever-expanding collection of bite-sized brilliance fits your on-the-move lifestyle.\r\n\r\n\u3010Trending\u3011\r\nGot Pregnant With My Ex Boss's Baby\r\nAs the boss's lover and subordinate, I find myself pregnant. Worse, I'm irrevocably in love. I love you, but I have to leave. Will we meet again? Will our love guide us back\uff1f\r\n\r\nBring It On, My Mafia Life\r\nSold for five million, Rhea was traded by her parents to the mafia Lukas. While Lukas was supposed to treat her as a mere plaything, he unexpectedly went to great lengths to protect her in the perilous world of the mafia. Does he genuinely love her, or is he merely considering her as part of a dangerous yet thrilling game?\r\n\r\n\u3010Features\u3011\r\n1. Bite-sized\uff0clightning-fast drama\uff1aWithin a few seconds, stories of secret admiration, rebuilt relationships, realized Dreames unfold as meticulously designed fast-paced scripts complete gripping narrative arcs right in your palm.\r\n2. New originals updating\uff1aOur library keeps expanding with brand new short dramas. We continually premiere original dramas to keep you entertained. Each one is meticulously designed with compact structures and superb acting, absolutely beyond imagination.\r\n3. Online-streaming: enjoy your dramas anytime, anywhere with full-screen, exclusive sound.\r\n\r\nDreameShort caters to your every desire! Try the all-new lightning-fast drama experience!\r\n\r\n\u3010Contact us\u3011 \r\nOfficial website: https://www.dreameshort.com/\r\nE-Mail: service@dreameshort.com\r\nTikTok Official: https://www.tiktok.com/@dreameshort_lovestory",
